<title>USA: Mallinckrodt Inc Q1 Sept 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Mallinckrodt Inc Q1 Sept 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.48		  $  0.46</p>
<p> Net			 36,100		   35,700</p>
<p> Revs		     541,400		  492,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 net includes one-time pre-tax research and development expense of $6 million or $0.05 a share related to strategic alliance with METASYN Inc to develop magnetic resonance imaging technology.  </p>
<p>1996 Q1 net excludes loss from discontinued operations equal to $0.01 a share vs a gain from discontinued operations equal to $0.04 a share in the 1995 Q1 period.</p>
<p>1996 average shares 75.5 million vs 77.9 million in 1995.</p>
<p>	     Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
